    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Kanna School, a very interesting and innovative side-scrolling tower defense game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Chibi Anime Characters: The characters in the game are exquisitely designed and adorable, each one vividly bringing you visual enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfortable UI Design: Adopting a visually pleasing anime illustration style, allowing you to enjoy a wonderful visual experience during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Battle Management System: A unique battle management system that lets you find a balance between strategy and operation, experiencing unprecedented battle fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Elements: Combining Rogue elements with side-scrolling tower defense gameplay, every game is a new challenge and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kanna School, you will command a team of anime characters to defend the school classroom against invasions from robot AI and various otherworldly enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes more than 10 teams of anime characters, each with its unique battle style and skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more exciting, the game will continue to update, bringing more exciting content and characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/684d0db441addfe4eb02a3312ee59a2f.avif?t=1728155466\" width=600 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/48254ba548c6360482897135d6108dd2.avif?t=1728155466\" width=600 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/e9785294a7d99e0346e28b024d60020e.avif?t=1728155466\" width=600 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/483d359bef92053fdc9157c56ebb57a4.avif?t=1728155466\" width=600 height=324 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Kanna School, a very interesting and innovative side-scrolling tower defense game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Chibi Anime Characters: The characters in the game are exquisitely designed and adorable, each one vividly bringing you visual enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfortable UI Design: Adopting a visually pleasing anime illustration style, allowing you to enjoy a wonderful visual experience during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative Battle Management System: A unique battle management system that lets you find a balance between strategy and operation, experiencing unprecedented battle fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Elements: Combining Rogue elements with side-scrolling tower defense gameplay, every game is a new challenge and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kanna School, you will command a team of anime characters to defend the school classroom against invasions from robot AI and various otherworldly enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes more than 10 teams of anime characters, each with its unique battle style and skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more exciting, the game will continue to update, bringing more exciting content and characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/684d0db441addfe4eb02a3312ee59a2f.avif?t=1728155466\" width=600 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/48254ba548c6360482897135d6108dd2.avif?t=1728155466\" width=600 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039990/extras/e9785294a7d99e0346e2